{"concept_id":"online-offline-consistency","content_sha256":"sha256:c93f4665913760446657e26e910b3455e89e1a0c3af31ebd1e4e27720e72a441","correct_option_ids":["a"],"domain":"ml-system-design","explanation":"训练服务偏差常来自特征定义、时间旅行、延迟和缺失值处理不一致；应先建立可复用定义与线上线下对账。","id":"q-company-feature-online-offline-consistency-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"训练和在线服务是否使用同一特征定义、时间截断规则及缺失值处理"},{"id":"b","text":"只增加模型层数"},{"id":"c","text":"只把离线 AUC 换成准确率"},{"id":"d","text":"删除所有实时特征"}],"prompt":"推荐或广告模型上线后离线指标很好、线上明显下降，关于 feature pipeline 最应优先排查什么？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"system-design","source_refs":[{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"ML System Design interview topic synthesis","url":"https://www.deep-ml.com/interview-prep/ml-system-design-general?role=ml-system-design"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"feature-store","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
